Prints what the relay proxy would run with: the file after the SEMAPHORE_* environment overrides and the
defaults. Secrets, API keys and admin keys print as [REDACTED]; references (fromEnv, fromFile) print as written.
--effective is required. Exit code 2 when the file is invalid.

Usage:
  semaphore-cli config print --effective <file> [flags]

Flags:
      --effective[=true|false]   print the effective configuration (required)
  -h, --help[=true|false]        help for print

Global Flags:
  -o, --output string   output format: text or json (YAML for print) (default "text")
